<<item: a bug that comes and goes>>,
<<item: what the crash says>>,
<<item: a crashing answer>>,
<<item: the line to change>>,
<<item: the telling run>>,
<<item: one print statement>>,
<<item: finding the bug>>,
<<item: after the fix>>
@

Reproducing: before anything can be located or explained, the failure
must be made to happen on demand.

